                                "sense_id": "1bada201-41ae-3a6a-95c3-b91c30b7f21a",
                                "text": "The Solana blockchain alone did more volume than Ethereum, Base and BSC's cumulative DEX activity of $37.9 billion, of which Ethereum accounted for $14.3 billion while the rest did over $11 billion each."
